    "title": "The Alchemist's Folly",
    "teaser": "Trapped in a dead alchemist's dungeon, outwit vermin and goblins to claim the Crimson Tear.",
    "cover_appearance": "underground stone vault door, glowing red gem, alchemical vials, dark fantasy dungeon, emerald and c",
