    "language": "English",
    "original_prompt": "Vex awakens in the Dusty Entryway of the Alchemist's Folly, a sprawling underground complex now overrun with mutated vermin and goblin scavengers. The only exit, a massive vault door, lies deep within, its lock requiring the legendary Crimson Tear—an artifact held by the goblin chieftain Grothak. To reach him, Vex must navigate vermin-infested pits, negotiate or fight through goblin-held encampments and barracks, and uncover the secrets of the crazed alchemist who built the Folly. Along the way, she may aid ghostly remnants, uncover forgotten lore, and gather resources to survive the ultimate confrontation.",
    "image_url": "assets/the-alchemists-folly-argo-gzjnuzzg_cover_0f29eff2.jpg",
