    "description": "A sharp-eyed delver clad in scuffed leather and soot-stained cloak, trapped beneath the earth after a floor collapse dropped her into the legendary Alchemist's Folly.",
    "goal": "Obtain the Crimson Tear from Chieftain Grothak, unlock the Vault Door in the Dusty Entryway, and escape to the surface.",
    "character": "Resourceful, pragmatic, quick-witted, and fiercely determined to survive against overwhelming odds.",
    "appearance": "lithe woman, short dark hair, sharp green eyes, scuffed leather vest, dark cloak, utility belt",
