      "text_log_content": "BY ORDER OF MASTER ARGON:\n\nThe Great Vault Seal responds only to the heart-stone of my creation, the Crimson Tear. Should containment fail in the Vermin Pits below, the emergency supply crate here is left unlatched for delvers.\n\nRemember the First Law of the Folly: Count what illuminates and what distills before trusting any goblin tally.",
