  "sequences": [
    {
      "id": "SEQ_1_AWAKENING",
      "order": 1,
      "title": "Chapter 1: Into the Vermin Pits",
      "description": "Vex awakens in the Dusty Entryway before the sealed Vault Door. She must gather basic survival gear, read the initial clues, and descend into the Vermin Pits to recover the Silver Dagger and Acidic Gland.",
      "walkthrough": "1. In the DUSTY_ENTRYWAY, read the ##WARNING_SIGN and ##TORN_JOURNAL_PAGE to learn about the Vault Door, Bitey's hoard, and the first clue to the Scavenger Chest code.\n2. Open the unlocked ##DUSTY_CRATE_1 and take the ##RUSTY_DAGGER and ##HEALTH_POTION_1. Equip the ##RUSTY_DAGGER.\n3. Head south into the VERMIN_PITS and defeat MUTATED_CAVE_RAT_1 (attacks on sight).\n4. Search the ##RAT_NEST_HOARD to take the ##SILVER_DAGGER, ##HEALTH_POTION_2, and ##ACIDIC_GLAND (taking the ##SILVER_DAGGER will provoke BITEY_ALPHA_RAT if not already defeated).\n5. Optionally go west into FUNGAL_GROTTO to count the 3 azure mushroom stalks, open ##SUNKEN_RELIQUARY for ##BOTANIST_SCROLL and ##MANA_POTION, and harvest ##GLOWING_SPORE_SAC.\n6. Proceed east into SCAVENGER_ENCAMPMENT to complete this chapter.",
      "end_condition": "",
      "required_item_id": "SILVER_DAGGER",
      "required_scene_id": "SCAVENGER_ENCAMPMENT",
      "required_defeated_npc_id": "",
      "guard_expression": "",
      "completion_guard_expression": "",
      "exp_reward": 100,
      "on_start_sequence_script": "",
      "on_start_sequence_text": "You brush the limestone dust from your cloak. To escape this tomb, you must brave the tunnels below.",
      "on_end_sequence_script": "",
      "on_end_sequence_text": "Having survived the Vermin Pits with the Alchemical Silver Dagger in hand, you step into the glow of the Scavenger Encampment."
    },
    {
      "id": "SEQ_2_ENCAMPMENT_AND_LAB",
      "order": 2,
      "title": "Chapter 2: Secrets of the Alchemist",
      "description": "In the Scavenger Encampment, Vex must deduce the 4-digit combination to the Scavenger Chest (2145), retrieve the Laboratory Key, unlock Argon's Laboratory, and consult the Ghost of Master Argon.",
      "walkthrough": "1. In SCAVENGER_ENCAMPMENT, talk to GOBLIN_SCOUT_SNIKT or read the ##GOBLIN_LEDGER on the crate. Note that reading the ##GOBLIN_LEDGER first disarms the poison needle trap on ##SCAVENGER_CHEST.\n2. Calculate the 4-digit code for ##SCAVENGER_CHEST: The Torn Journal Page, Botanist Scroll, and Goblin Ledger explain that the first two digits are (3 azure mushroom stalks in Fungal Grotto) x (7 brass stills in Lab) = 21, and the last two digits in the Goblin Ledger are 45 -> Code: 2145.\n3. Unlock ##SCAVENGER_CHEST with code 2145 and take ##LABORATORY_KEY, ##WORN_LEATHER_ARMOR, and ##HEALTH_POTION_3.\n4. Unlock the north exit to ALCHEMIST_LABORATORY using ##LABORATORY_KEY and enter.\n5. Speak with MAD_ALCHEMIST_GHOST and pick up/read ##ALCHEMIST_NOTES to unlock the Argon Alchemical Flare special attack and learn the riddle answer 'mercury' for ##LAB_CABINET.\n6. Optionally unlock ##LAB_CABINET with code 'mercury' to get ##HEALTH_POTION_4, and combine ##GLOWING_SPORE_SAC + ##ACIDIC_GLAND to craft ##ALCHEMICAL_FIREBOMB.",
      "end_condition": "",
      "required_item_id": "ALCHEMIST_NOTES",
      "required_scene_id": "ALCHEMIST_LABORATORY",
      "required_defeated_npc_id": "",
      "guard_expression": "",
      "completion_guard_expression": "",
      "exp_reward": 150,
      "on_start_sequence_script": "",
      "on_start_sequence_text": "Goblin voices echo around the campfire, and the brass-bound door to Argon's Laboratory awaits to the north.",
      "on_end_sequence_script": "",
      "on_end_sequence_text": "With Master Argon's notes in your possession and his spectral guidance echoing in your mind, you are ready to storm the Goblin Barracks."
    },
    {
      "id": "SEQ_3_BARRACKS_BREACH",
      "order": 3,
      "title": "Chapter 3: Breaching the Sanctum Gate",
      "description": "Vex must enter the Goblin Barracks, acquire the Quartermaster's Key from Snaggle (by combat, trade, or guile), and raise the portcullis to the Inner Sanctum.",
      "walkthrough": "1. From SCAVENGER_ENCAMPMENT, go south into GOBLIN_BARRACKS.\n2. Confront or negotiate with SNAGGLE_QUARTERMASTER and GOBLIN_GRUNT_1 to obtain ##QUARTERMASTER_KEY (and ##QUARTERMASTER_NOTE).\n3. Optionally use ##QUARTERMASTER_KEY to unlock ##BARRACKS_LOCKBOX and obtain ##RUSTY_SHORTSWORD and ##GOBLIN_GRUNT_RATIONS_2.\n4. Use ##QUARTERMASTER_KEY on the ##SANCTUM_GATE_LEVER switch (or directly on the eastern portcullis exit) to unlock the path to INNER_SANCTUM.\n5. Enter INNER_SANCTUM to trigger the final confrontation.",
      "end_condition": "",
      "required_item_id": "QUARTERMASTER_KEY",
      "required_scene_id": "INNER_SANCTUM",
      "required_defeated_npc_id": "",
      "guard_expression": "",
      "completion_guard_expression": "",
      "exp_reward": 150,
      "on_start_sequence_script": "",
      "on_start_sequence_text": "South of the encampment lies the Goblin Barracks, guarding the only approach to Grothak's Inner Sanctum.",
      "on_end_sequence_script": "",
      "on_end_sequence_text": "The spiked portcullis grinds upward, and you stride into the ruby-lit Inner Sanctum!"
    },
    {
      "id": "SEQ_4_CRIMSON_ESCAPE",
      "order": 4,
      "title": "Chapter 4: The Crimson Tear & Freedom",
      "description": "Vex faces Chieftain Grothak in the Inner Sanctum, claims the Crimson Tear, and returns to the Dusty Entryway to unseal the Great Vault Door and reach the Surface.",
      "walkthrough": "1. In INNER_SANCTUM, fight and defeat GOBLIN_CHIEFTAIN_GROTHAK (use Argon Alchemical Flare, Shadow Strike, and your crafted Alchemical Firebomb or Silver Dagger/Shortsword).\n2. Upon Grothak's defeat, receive or pick up the ##CRIMSON_TEAR.\n3. Retrace your steps through GOBLIN_BARRACKS, SCAVENGER_ENCAMPMENT, and VERMIN_PITS back to DUSTY_ENTRYWAY.\n4. Unlock the northern Vault Door exit using ##CRIMSON_TEAR and step out onto the SURFACE to win the adventure!",
      "end_condition": "",
      "required_item_id": "CRIMSON_TEAR",
      "required_scene_id": "SURFACE",
      "required_defeated_npc_id": "GOBLIN_CHIEFTAIN_GROTHAK",
      "guard_expression": "",
      "completion_guard_expression": "",
      "exp_reward": 300,
      "on_start_sequence_script": "",
      "on_start_sequence_text": "Chieftain Grothak hefted his spiked maul as the Crimson Tear blazes against his chest. Only one of you will leave this sanctum.",
      "on_end_sequence_script": "",
      "on_end_sequence_text": "With the Vault Door unsealed by the Crimson Tear, you ascend into the warm mountain sunlight—free at last!"
    }
  ],
  "scripts": [
    {
      "id": "SCRIPT_SCAVENGER_CHEST_TRAP",
      "name": "Scavenger Chest Poison Needle Trap",
      "trigger": "on_interact",
      "target_id": "SCAVENGER_CHEST",
      "target": "SCAVENGER_CHEST",
      "code": "if not tw.vars.get('read_goblin_ledger', False) and not tw.vars.get('chest_trap_sprung', False) and not tw.player.has_item('PICKLOCK_SET'):\n    tw.vars.set('chest_trap_sprung', True)\n    tw.player.damage(10)\n    tw.story.show_message('A hidden goblin needle springs from the dial housing, pricking your thumb! (-10 HP. Reading the Goblin Ledger or carrying a Picklock Set avoids this trap.)')",
      "description": "Springs a one-time 10 HP needle trap if the player tampers with the Scavenger Chest before reading the warning in the Goblin Ledger or acquiring Snikt's Picklock Set."
    },
    {
      "id": "SCRIPT_GHOST_BLESSING_ON_LAB_NOTES",
      "name": "Argon's Spectral Blessing",
      "trigger": "on_enter_scene",
      "target_id": "INNER_SANCTUM",
      "target": "INNER_SANCTUM",
      "code": "if tw.vars.get('read_alchemist_notes', False) and not tw.vars.get('argon_blessing_granted', False):\n    tw.vars.set('argon_blessing_granted', True)\n    tw.player.heal(20)\n    tw.player.modify_mana(25)\n    tw.story.show_message('Master Argon\\'s spectral voice echoes in your mind: \"Evict that brute from my sanctum!\" A warm alchemical aura restores +20 HP and +25 Mana!')",
      "description": "When entering the Inner Sanctum after studying Master Argon's Research Notes, Argon's spirit grants a restorative blessing before the boss fight."
    },
    {
      "id": "SCRIPT_CRIMSON_TEAR_RESONANCE",
      "name": "Crimson Tear Vault Resonance",
      "trigger": "on_enter_scene",
      "target_id": "DUSTY_ENTRYWAY",
      "target": "DUSTY_ENTRYWAY",
      "code": "if tw.player.has_item('CRIMSON_TEAR') and not tw.vars.get('tear_resonated', False):\n    tw.vars.set('tear_resonated', True)\n    tw.story.show_message('The Crimson Tear blazes like a miniature sun in your pack, answering the call of the empty socket on the massive Vault Door!')",
      "description": "Notifies the player of the Crimson Tear's resonance when returning to the Dusty Entryway with the artifact."
    }
  ]
}